<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 188 0 R
/T (Welcome to UCBMUN XXXI! We are Hannah Audrey Fielder and Katie Quynh Tran, and we are so honored to serve as your Secretary-General and Director-General for the oldest premier collegiate Model UN conference on the West Coast. We are incredibly thrilled, on behalf of our lovely Secretariat and amazing Staff, to welcome you back to the InterContinental San Francisco to participate in a weekend full of lively, intellectual, and exciting debate. We cannot wait to see what creative ideas all of our delegates come up with this year!)
/E (Welcome to UCBMUN XXXI! We are Hannah Audrey Fielder and Katie Quynh Tran, and we are so honored to serve as your Secretary-General and Director-General for the oldest premier collegiate Model UN conference on the West Coast. We are incredibly thrilled, on behalf of our lovely Secretariat and amazing Staff, to welcome you back to the InterContinental San Francisco to participate in a weekend full of lively, intellectual, and exciting debate. We cannot wait to see what creative ideas all of our delegates come up with this year!)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
213 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 188 0 R
/T (Famous for its creativity, counterculture, and commitment to social justice, San Francisco is the perfect place to host one of the largest West Coast conferences on the Collegiate circuit. As the city that hosted the signing of the UN Charter in 1945, San Francisco holds a special place in the spirit of debate, and UCBMUN holds these ideals close to our hearts. At UCBMUN, we aim to create innovative committees and challenge delegates to reach their full potential in international debate. Whether going back in time to discuss French Polynesian policy, into televised media to make or break hearts, or discussing the ethics of global water quality for the future, our conference promises some of the most engaging committees in Collegiate Model UN. Our dedicated team of over 100 staffers, all with competitive experience on the circuit, is committed to fostering a weekend filled with substantive debate, inventive committee mechanics, and the opportunity to connect with your fellow delegates both inside and outside the committee.)
/E (Famous for its creativity, counterculture, and commitment to social justice, San Francisco is the perfect place to host one of the largest West Coast conferences on the Collegiate circuit. As the city that hosted the signing of the UN Charter in 1945, San Francisco holds a special place in the spirit of debate, and UCBMUN holds these ideals close to our hearts. At UCBMUN, we aim to create innovative committees and challenge delegates to reach their full potential in international debate. Whether going back in time to discuss French Polynesian policy, into televised media to make or break hearts, or discussing the ethics of global water quality for the future, our conference promises some of the most engaging committees in Collegiate Model UN. Our dedicated team of over 100 staffers, all with competitive experience on the circuit, is committed to fostering a weekend filled with substantive debate, inventive committee mechanics, and the opportunity to connect with your fellow delegates both inside and outside the committee.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
214 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 188 0 R
/T (At UCBMUN, the well-being of our delegates is our utmost priority. Please do not hesitate to reach out to us regarding anything from conference registration to the best places to eat in San Francisco! We are always available to address any issues that may arise. Once again, on behalf of us and our staff, we are beyond excited to welcome you back to the historic city of San Francisco. Join us at UCBMUN XXXI from March 11th to March 14th, 2027, for an unforgettable weekend. )
/E (At UCBMUN, the well-being of our delegates is our utmost priority. Please do not hesitate to reach out to us regarding anything from conference registration to the best places to eat in San Francisco! We are always available to address any issues that may arise. Once again, on behalf of us and our staff, we are beyond excited to welcome you back to the historic city of San Francisco. Join us at UCBMUN XXXI from March 11th to March 14th, 2027, for an unforgettable weekend. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
