/Title (Welcome to UCBMUN XXXI! We are Hannah Audrey Fielder and Katie Quynh Tran, and we are so honored to serve as your Secretary-General and Director-General for the oldest premier collegiate Model UN conference on the West Coast. We are incredibly thrilled, on behalf of our lovely Secretariat and amazing Staff, to welcome you back to the InterContinental San Francisco to participate in a weekend full of lively, intellectual, and exciting debate. We cannot wait to see what creative ideas all of our delegates come up with this year!)
