1291 0 obj
<<
/Title (Famous for its creativity, counterculture, and commitment to social justice, San Francisco is the perfect place to host one of the largest West Coast conferences on the Collegiate circuit. As the city that hosted the signing of the UN Charter in 1945, San Francisco holds a special place in the spirit of debate, and UCBMUN holds these ideals close to our hearts. At UCBMUN, we aim to create innovative committees and challenge delegates to reach their full potential in international debate. Whether going back in time to discuss French Polynesian policy, into televised media to make or break hearts, or discussing the ethics of global water quality for the future, our conference promises some of the most engaging committees in Collegiate Model UN. Our dedicated team of over 100 staffers, all with competitive experience on the circuit, is committed to fostering a weekend filled with substantive debate, inventive committee mechanics, and the opportunity to connect with your fellow delegates both inside and outside the committee.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 500 0 R
/Prev 1160 0 R
/Next 1369 0 R
