/Title (At UCBMUN, the well-being of our delegates is our utmost priority. Please do not hesitate to reach out to us regarding anything from conference registration to the best places to eat in San Francisco! We are always available to address any issues that may arise. Once again, on behalf of us and our staff, we are beyond excited to welcome you back to the historic city of San Francisco. Join us at UCBMUN XXXI from March 11th to March 14th, 2027, for an unforgettable weekend.)
